<metadata><name>Day 34 - Hockley Heights, Hemlock Ridge, Glacier Valley</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.993572" lon="-80.014057"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Bruce Trail parking on the east side of the 5th Line EHS, just south of the Hockley Rd</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.019413" lon="-80.029334"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.993525" lon="-80.014205"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: You pass the start again. Keep going on the blue-blazed Hockley Heights Side Trail, heading south-east.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.991273" lon="-80.012022"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.989757" lon="-80.012608"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Glacier Valley Side Trail, heading east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.991945" lon="-80.007521"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn sharp left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.991762" lon="-80.010281"><name>J6</name><desc>J6: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Hemlock Ridge Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
